      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW XEROX (1) finds it hard to win but has a consistent overall record, having placed 21 of 35 career runs. Finished third (30.05) at this track last time making it two minors on end. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Ready to find winning form. PAW CORNELIUS (3) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 3 lengths (29.96) at this track in a Grade 5 over 515m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Expected to be in the finish again. STARLET BALE (8) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at The Meadows over 525m behind Speedy Jude (30.79) in a Grade 5. Has ability and can measure up. HIS SPECIAL (2) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
